      "title": "Hackers force French supermarket fridges to heat up to 50C in ‘unprecedented’ cyber-attack",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/12/cyber-attack-defrosts-refrigerators-france-supermarket-chains-intermarche-cooperative-u",
      "description": "<p>Hundreds of Intermarché shops and Coopérative U outlets in France hit, with fears Dutch chains also affected</p><p>Hackers have forced the temperature of many French supermarket fridges up to 50C overnight, in an “unprecedented” cyber-attack affecting several hundred stores across the country, with fires and food losses reported.</p><p>The Paris prosecutor’s office said on Monday ⁠the large-scale attack was “affecting connected refrigerators ⁠in several ​major food retailers across France”. Reported damage included “food losses and fires”, it added.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/12/cyber-attack-defrosts-refrigerators-france-supermarket-chains-intermarche-cooperative-u\">Continue reading...</a>",
